<title>USA: American Radio names co-chief oper officer.</title>
<headline>American Radio names co-chief oper officer.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Radio Systems Corp said on Tuesday that Don Bouloukos has been named co-chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Bouloukos has served as president of Capital Cities/ABC-owned radio stations for the past 10 years, American Radio Systems said.</p>
<p>In May, he left Capital Cities/ABC to &quot;consider some other options in radio,&quot; under a restructuring of the radio operations at the Walt Disney Co unit, Capital Cities/ABC Radio said in a May announcement.</p>
